5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Before we move furniture, I need to understand the actual monthly cost of this floor.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know which spots are quiet and comfortable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Victoria, that’s a fair point, but I’m more worried about how this mess will eat into my actual work time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,You’re all focused on comfort and cost. I’m focused on fairness. Who gets the bad seats?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit worried about who I’ll sit next to. It changes how much I talk to everyone.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, fairness is important, but we can't assign seats without knowing the financial constraints first.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, I agree. I also want to know how long it takes to get settled each morning.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, exactly. I need to know the time cost of the transition and the daily routine.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your concern is valid. But if we don't define the rules, the ""bad"" seats will just be assigned by whoever grabs them first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I agree. I’m just afraid the current setup is accidental. I want to understand what that actually costs us in connection.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, your comfort is valid, but I need the billing basis to see if we can afford the changes you want.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand. But please, let’s also look at the sound levels and the physio’s notes. My body needs to be okay.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, I hear you, but I need to see the morning routine timings and the badge records. I can’t plan around unknown delays.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, cost is a constraint, not a decision. I need to see the unplanned shuffles and the arrival times to understand how seats actually get claimed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, I understand the budget. But I need to see the project strands and what the new joiners reported. I want to know what we lose if we sit apart.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I’ll look into the floor billing and the facilities quote. We need to know the true cost before committing to any layout.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,I’ll look into the sound meter readings and the physio’s note. I need to know if my body will be okay there.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I’ll check the morning routine timings and the badge records. I need to know exactly how much time this layout steals from my day.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the unplanned shuffles and the arrival times. I need to see how seats are actually claimed before we pretend to be fair.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look into the two project strands and what the new joiners reported. I need to know what we lose if we sit apart.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
