71,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I hope the window side is quiet enough. I just need my body to rest.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I stand by it. The noise is a small price for reclaiming my morning gaps.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
