74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I understand. But if I’m grouped with my closest collaborators, I won’t be isolated. I just need to be near people I talk to.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
